BEHAVIOR build-post
DESCRIPTION
  Builds a minimal HTTP/1.1 POST request: a fixed request line + CRLFCRLF,
  followed by the body bytes. Returns the full request buffer and total length.
  Composition: assembles via string-to-bytes + copy (cannot compute directly).
CONTRACT
  INPUT body bytes 65536
  INPUT body_length int 8
  OUTPUT request bytes 65536
  OUTPUT length int 8
  REQUIRES string-to-bytes@a2e66e29 copy@05c62b49 iadd@8b41ba23
HASH 684d6c50
COMPOSITION
  hdr = CALL string-to-bytes "POST / HTTP/1.1\r\n\r\n"
  hc = CALL copy hdr.data 0 request 0 hdr.length
  DISCARD hc.bytes_copied
  bc = CALL copy body 0 request hdr.length body_length
  DISCARD bc.bytes_copied
  total = CALL iadd hdr.length body_length
  SET length total.sum
END
